  "description": "\"Just stay alive, young master.\"\n\nSora has descended from the mountains to guard the sickly Jungha. The two have a set of rules to guide them: One, Sora decides what is considered an emergency. Two, Jungha must listen to Sora in an emergency. Three, Jungha must not bully Sora. Will they be able to stick to them?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes a prologue and 3 side stories*",
